# Named retention policies, referenced by name from shares.conf so
# each share can keep a different history.
#
# Format (whitespace-separated): name  keep_daily  keep_weekly  keep_monthly  keep_yearly
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored. Values map
# to restic's forget flags applied by restic-maintenance.sh:
#   keep_daily   -> --keep-within <N>d  (every scheduled snapshot from
#                   the last N days - a rolling window, not restic's
#                   own --keep-daily "latest per calendar day" bucketing)
#   keep_weekly/monthly/yearly -> --keep-weekly/--keep-monthly/--keep-yearly
# 0 means "keep none at that tier". restic-maintenance.sh only ever
# applies this to snapshots tagged RESTIC_BACKUP_TAG (default
# "scheduled") - manual backups (`restic-backup.sh --manual`) are never
# auto-forgotten, so they can't take a scheduled snapshot's slot.
#
# The three shipped here mirror Cohesity's short/mid/long retention
# tiers - adjust the numbers (and add more named policies) to match
# your actual policies.
#
# name          daily   weekly  monthly yearly
short           30      0       0       0
mid             14      12      6       0
long            7       8       24      7
